OL,3,GNEWSA'Rescuing animals has been my
OL,4,Alife's work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Jim Green joined the fire service
OL,7,Fin 1996 rescuing animals often meant
OL,8,Flittle more than determination,
OL,9,Fguesswork and a willingness to get
OL,10,Fmuddy.
OL,12,FThree decades later, techniques he
OL,13,Fhelped pioneer at Hampshire and Isle of
OL,14,FWight Fire and Rescue are being used by
OL,15,Femergency services across the UK and
OL,16,Faround the world, helping him earn the
OL,17,FNew Forest Diamond Jubilee Award.
OL,19,FThe accolade recognises people who have
OL,20,Fmade a significant contribution to the
OL,21,Fforest and rural communities.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
