OL,3,GNEWSA'Rescuing animals has been my
OL,4,Alife's work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLyndhurst based Green, an animal rescue
OL,7,Ftactical adviser for the fire service
OL,8,Fand director of the British Animal
OL,9,FRescue and Trauma Care Association,
OL,10,Fsaid the award marked the latest
OL,11,Fchapter in "a life's work".
